# Local secrets — docs/PHASE8_REMOTE_AGENT.md's local agent config (holds
# a Supabase service-role key in plain text; only bin/remote_agent.config.
# example.json, the template, is committed). The default name is
# remote_agent.config.json; a computer running more than one agent (e.g.
# the default `@서버` one alongside a specific employee's) names each
# instance's file remote_agent.<anything>.config.json via --config.
bin/remote_agent.config.json
bin/remote_agent.*.config.json

